Layered comparator recovery licence, prepared 2026-11-18.
Upstream portions retain the complete grants in NOTICE and licenses/.
Unchanged arithmetic in src/lib.rs and original-source/ remains MIT.
Prior obtained MIT copies and their rebuild rights remain unchanged.
Only new family tags, packaging, planner, wrapper and campaign metadata use SAND.
No exclusive SAND claim is made over the unchanged MIT executable program.
This is a prospective release. Its publication commit is not yet assigned.
The controller records the publication commit before publication.

